      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-27T18:55:46Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, deployment transaction, runtime at deployment and pre-exploit, disassembly, commit-pinned reproduction, and technical incident analysis. The trace calls flashLoan(), re-enters deposit() from onFlashLoan(), and then redeems the inflated shares on direct contract 0xff152e21c5a511c478ed23d1b89bb9391be6de96. Its 23,572-byte runtime hashes to 0xb1aca4a8d95f1d28a7037b32c6d31e9561c9b99dd9b7dbdd9308e3a0281732ff at deployment block 19817058 and pre-exploit block 24003940, contains no SELFDESTRUCT, and does not delegate its execution in the exploit. Deployment transaction 0xc9873aaede77195cbf5604be044ff155ff67ce6024e65958a95c6c771c12d413 occurred at 19817058:2, timestamp 1663037518, giving age 8,757,347 seconds. Receipt-level USDC transfers leave the attacker EOA/helper cluster with exactly 173,637.629135 USDC after repayment; the external analysis independently reports $173,637 of proceeds."
    },
